+++ b/output/stack-installer/p1-live/NEXT_ACTIONS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@
+# Stack Installer P1 macOS Next Actions
+
+## Give These To The Mac Operator
+
+```text
+output/stack-installer/p1-live/mac-handoff/stack-installer-p1-macos-handoff-cedc46b905.tgz
+output/stack-installer/p1-live/mac-handoff/stack-installer-p1-macos-handoff-cedc46b905.tgz.sha256
+```
+
+Current handoff checksum:
+
+```text
+f920d4c9cb99ed4a047969fe08bd5e1bebb03e923b3b65895a36e1c203a1e17c  stack-installer-p1-macos-handoff-cedc46b905.tgz
+```
+
+## Values The Operator Needs
+
+- Discord guild ID, or a 1Password reference that resolves to it
+- Discord channel ID, or a 1Password reference that resolves to it
+- Discord channel display name, or a 1Password reference that resolves to it
+- Discord bot token 1Password reference shaped like `op://vault/item/field`
+
+Do not paste or transfer a plaintext Discord token. The bot token reference
+must point to the bot token field, not the guild ID or channel ID field.
+
+## Expected Returned File
+
+```text
+output/stack-installer/p1-live/stack-installer-p1-macos.tgz
+```
+
+## Coordinator Intake
+
+After receiving the returned bundle, run from the repository root:
+
+```bash
+./output/stack-installer/p1-live/INTAKE_MACOS_PROOF.sh /path/to/stack-installer-p1-macos.tgz
+```
+
+The helper copies the bundle into `output/stack-installer/p1-live/`, extracts
+`macos/`, runs the macOS audit, and prints proof status.
+
+The goal is complete only after that audit passes and these files exist under
+`output/stack-installer/p1-live/macos/`:
+
+```text
+proof.json
+commands.txt
+sha256sums.txt
+screencast.*
+```
