+# Start Here
+
+Use this first on the MacBook Pro. Open `MAC_OPERATOR_RUNBOOK.md` only when
+you need the longer explanation.
+
+## 1. Unpack The Handoff
+
+```bash
+mkdir -p ~/stack-installer-p1-handoff
+cp stack-installer-p1-macos-handoff-cedc46b905.tgz* ~/stack-installer-p1-handoff/
+cd ~/stack-installer-p1-handoff
+shasum -a 256 -c stack-installer-p1-macos-handoff-cedc46b905.tgz.sha256
+tar -xzf stack-installer-p1-macos-handoff-cedc46b905.tgz
+```
+
+## 2. Unpack The Source
+
